    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92390" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῑγ-εδᾰνός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>making one shudder</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥιγεδανὴ Ἑλένη</span>
			<i>at whose name one shudders, horrible</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				19.325
			</span></i>; so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. γῆρυς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.1343
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				5.37
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοῖραν ῥιγεδανοῦ βιότου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(3).869.10
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Thera</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>shivery, cold</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. πηγυλίς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.384.24
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Tryph.
					558
				</span></i>
			.</div>
